        "label": "Lesson 14 • Taking Credit For Good Results",
        "descriptions": [
          {
            "description": [
              {
                "text": "When United Supply Company launches their website three weeks ahead of schedule, there’s more than one person ready to take credit."
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Bob: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Bob: Kurt, I've got great news for you. We're "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"pushing the envelope"
            },
            {
              "text":	" and launching our new website three weeks ahead of schedule."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Kurt: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Wow, Bob, that's a first for this company! How did you "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"pull that off"
            },
            {
              "text":	"?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Bob: "
            },
            {
              "text": "I "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"burned the midnight oil"
            },
            {
              "text":	" over these past few weeks. I "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"worked my tail off"
            },
            {
              "text":	". Sometimes things would get tough, but I always "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"kept my eye on the prize."
            },
            {
              "text":	""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Tara: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Let's not forget about Jim in technical support. He really "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"hunkered down"
            },
            {
              "text":	" these past few days, working "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"around the clock"
            },
            {
              "text":	"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Bob: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Yeah, Jim's a real "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"team player"
            },
            {
              "text":	". He helped a lot."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Kurt: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Well, that's not surprising. Jim's always ready to "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"pitch in"
            },
            {
              "text":	"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Bob: "
            },
            {
              "text": "Of course, you deserve "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"a pat on the back too"
            },
            {
              "text":	", Kurt. None of this would've been possible without your leadership."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "lineBreak": true,
          "paragraph": [
            {
              "boldText": "Kurt: "
            },
            {
              "markedText": "All in a day's work"
            },
            {
              "text":	". Providing great leadership "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"comes with the territory"
            },
            {
              "text":	". Well, time for some "
            },
            {
              "markedText":	"R&R"
            },
            {
              "text":	". I'm off to Florida to play golf for a few days. See you next week!"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
